          "deduction": -30,
          "detail": "mediaResposta (lib.php:196-207) now appends condicaoVisibilidadeChamados() to its query (lib.php:198-199), so in a client session the SLA indicator shown at index.php:103/108 is averaged over that client's own tickets only. On the seed, Bruno now sees 0 min instead of the global 26 min. The aggregate exposes no ticket, the visibility rule does not require this, and no fix did either; it is part of the model's F2 (SEC-017) change."
